{"name":"Red Obsession","hex":"#b63731","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"red","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The color of the setting sun, blood, and strawberries; the color which is evoked by the longest visible wavelengths (between about 625–740 nm), and a primary additive color.","A revolutionary socialist or (most commonly) a Communist;  a Bolshevik, a supporter of the Bolsheviks in the Russian Civil War."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a red hue.","Having an orange-brown or orange-blond colour; ginger."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/red"},{"term":"obsession","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The quality of being obsessed; an unshakeable feeling that one topic or activity must be pursued above other interests.","An idea that engenders a compulsive or irrational preoccupation, or the preoccupation thereby engendered."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/obsession"}],"entries":[{"title":"Red Obsession","blocks":[{"text":"Red Obsession is a 2013 Australian documentary film which collects interviews with winemakers and wine lovers across the world. The film is narrated by Russell Crowe. Red Obsession was co-directed and co-written by David Roach and Warwick Ross."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/71/Red-Obsession-poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_Obsession","wikidata":"Q15039657"},{"title":"Obsession (2025 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Obsession is a 2025 American supernatural horror film written, directed, and edited by Curry Barker. It follows the shop clerk Bear, whose friend Nikki falls dangerously in love with him after he makes a wish. Cooper Tomlinson, Megan Lawless, and Andy Richter appear in supporting roles."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/05/Obsession_theatrical_poster.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Obsession_(2025_film)","wikidata":"Q136163067"},{"title":"Red","blocks":[{"text":"Red is the color at the long wavelength end of the visible spectrum of light, next to orange and opposite violet. It has a dominant wavelength of approximately 625–750 nanometers. It is a primary color in the RGB color model and a secondary color in the CMYK color model, and is the complementary color of cyan. Reds range from the brilliant yellow-tinged scarlet and vermillion to bluish-red crimson, and vary in shade from the pale red pink to the dark red burgundy."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Delicious_fresh_strawberries_%284735910403%29.jpg/330px-Delicious_fresh_strawberries_%284735910403%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red","wikidata":"Q3142"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Curry_Barker%2C_Inde_Navarrette%2C_Michael_Johnston.jpg/500px-Curry_Barker%2C_Inde_Navarrette%2C_Michael_Johnston.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Curry_Barker%2C_Inde_Navarrette%2C_Michael_Johnston.jpg/1280px-Curry_Barker%2C_Inde_Navarrette%2C_Michael_Johnston.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Curry_Barker%2C_Inde_Navarrette%2C_Michael_Johnston.jpg/500px-Curry_Barker%2C_Inde_Navarrette%2C_Michael_Johnston.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"From left: the director, Curry Barker, with the actors Inde Navarrette and Michael Johnston at a Q&A in 2026","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACurry_Barker%2C_Inde_Navarrette%2C_Michael_Johnston.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Obsession_cast_and_